<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Docopilot: Improving Multimodal Models for Document-Level Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Training Details</span></a>
