<p id="S9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the models and training hyperparameters of Docopilot-2B and Docopilot-8B in Table <a href="#S9.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ 9.1 Hyperparameters ‣ 9 Training Details ‣ Docopilot: Improving Multimodal Models for Document-Level Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
